00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.320
the data they're given.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:38.820
Right?

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.170
You could imagine a
DBA, or someone that's

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.660
kind of running SRE for a
