00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.370
This is a cleansed version.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:32.669
Well, what if I want to
see the initial version,

00:21:32.669 --> 00:21:34.210
before I actually
ran all these steps

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:35.870
that are here on the right.

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:38.620
So I can click on a step, and
now it's actually showing me

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:41.560
the output before that step.

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:45.410
I'm sorry, the version right
after it executed that step.

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:48.330
So you'll see, I've got
things like the movie ID,

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:50.690
the title with the year
still in the title,

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:53.360
and the genres as a
